{"id":"n62441-8-7","stage":1,"title":"세상 · 根本","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62441-8-7-1","ko":"큰아들이 사춘기라더니 요즘은 어때?","zh":"听说大儿子到了青春期，最近怎么样？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"큰아들이","meaning":"大儿子","explanation":"큰아들：大儿子；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"큰아들","audio":"/audio/689df3659246e585197a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28174","senseId":"1","lemma":"큰아들","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"큰아들이","audio":"/audio/92ae4674c42750ca9c0f.mp3"}},{"text":"사춘기라더니","meaning":"青春期","explanation":"사춘기：青春期；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；라더니：引用先前听来的名词判断或命令，再说明后来的情况。","readings":[{"term":"사춘기","audio":"/audio/e02d2bc35308b4fabe59.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15905","senseId":"1","lemma":"사춘기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사춘기라더니","audio":"/audio/0349ac725429828b8d8e.mp3"}},{"text":"요즘은","meaning":"最近，近来，这阵子","explanation":"요즘：最近，近来，这阵子；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20250","senseId":"1","lemma":"요즘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"요즘은","audio":"/audio/e48ea92a2eef5b38ed37.mp3"}},{"text":"어때?","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어때","audio":"/audio/b8638c1eedbc8ab7e09d.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"689df3659246e585","term":"큰아들","zh":"大儿子","audio":"/audio/689df3659246e585197a.mp3","entryId":"28174","definition":"在两个或两个以上的儿子中，排行最大的儿子。","pronunciation":["크나들"]},{"id":"e02d2bc35308b4fa","term":"사춘기","zh":"青春期","audio":"/audio/e02d2bc35308b4fabe59.mp3","entryId":"15905","definition":"一般指十二岁到十八岁左右，生理和精神上逐渐成长为成人的时期。","pronunciation":["사춘기"]},{"id":"828c4030dd68aa7b","term":"요즘","zh":"最近，近来，这阵子","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3","ent